---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const body = "\n<header class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"ph-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('/img/hunt-ridge.jpg')\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Oak savanna ridges west of Red Bluff at first light, fog in the creek bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"page-hero-inner\">\n    <div class=\"crumb mono\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Hunting</span></div>\n    <h1>Southern-style quail hunting</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Thoughts of Southern-style quail hunting call up field edges and head-high brush. It does not have to be a memory.</p>\n    <div class=\"ph-meta\"></div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"page-body\">\n  <article class=\"prose\">\n    <p class=\"deck\">Since 1965 the goal at Red Bank has been the quail hunt. We do not mix groups. That is the whole point of coming.</p>\n<p>We can put 14 people in the main lodge and 6 in the bunkhouse. There is no minimum group size. The trip is about your enjoyment.</p>\n<p>A typical upland party is two guests, one guide, and three or four dogs. The guides have years on these dogs and this ground. If you bring your own dogs they are welcome \u2014 there is a kennel at both buildings.</p>\n<p>There are few sights in the outdoors more reverent than a brace of bird dogs on point. It is almost better than the shooting.</p>\n<h2>What to hunt</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/upland/bobwhite\">Southern-style bobwhite quail</a> \u2014 the plantation walk-up</li>\n<li><a href=\"/upland/valley-quail\">Wild valley quail</a> \u2014 October through January, 5,000 acres north of the ranch</li>\n<li><a href=\"/upland/mountain-quail\">Mountain quail</a> \u2014 a 30-minute drive into chaparral</li>\n<li><a href=\"/upland/pheasant\">Walk-up pheasant</a> and the <a href=\"/upland/european-drive\">European-style drive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/upland/turkey\">Rio Grande turkey</a> \u2014 fall or spring, under California seasons</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hunts/blacktail\">Blacktail deer</a> \u2014 three days, all inclusive</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hunts/wild-hog\">Wild hog</a> \u2014 UTV or on foot, 18,000 acres</li>\n</ul>\n    \n    \n  </article>\n  <aside class=\"aside\">\n      <h3>Booking and Reservations</h3>\n      <p>Contact us for reservations and pricing. Groups are never mixed, and there is no minimum party size.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span>Phone</span><b><a href=\"tel:+15305299435\">(530) 529-9435</a></b></div><div class=\"row\"><span>Email</span><b><a href=\"mailto:Hunting@RedBankOutfitters.com\">Hunting@RedBankOutfitters.com</a></b></div><div class=\"row\"><span>Address</span><b>18875 Red Bank Rd.<br>Red Bluff, CA 96080</b></div>\n      <a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+15305299435\" style=\"margin-top:20px;width:100%;text-align:center\">Call Us at (530) 529-9435</a>\n      <a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"mailto:Hunting@RedBankOutfitters.com\" style=\"margin-top:10px;width:100%;text-align:center;justify-content:center\">Send message</a>\n    </aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"related\"><h2>Also on the ranch</h2><div class=\"rel-grid\"><a class=\"rel\" href=\"/upland\"><div class=\"img\" style=\"background-image:url('/img/pointer.jpg')\"></div><h3>Upland <em>birds</em></h3><p>Bobwhite, valley and mountain quail, pheasant, chukar, turkey.</p></a><a class=\"rel\" href=\"/hunts\"><div class=\"img\" style=\"background-image:url('/img/creek.jpg')\"></div><h3>The <em>hunt</em></h3><p>Two guns, one guide, three or four dogs.</p></a><a class=\"rel\" href=\"/lodge\"><div class=\"img\" style=\"background-image:url('/img/lodge-wide.jpg')\"></div><h3>The <em>Lodge</em></h3><p>Sleeps 14. Fireplace, kitchen, porch, kennel on site.</p></a></div></div>\n";
---
<Base title="The Hunt \u2014 Red Bank Outfitters" description="Two guests, one guide, three or four dogs. Groups are not mixed. Since 1965 in Red Bluff." active="upland" inner={true}>
  <Fragment set:html={body} />
</Base>
